escape means was a blessed scroll of teleportation, but the arch-lich will
teleport-follow quickly to where ever I land, so I did not want to waste it.
And then I got lucky, sort of. An umber hulk confused me just before that
minotaur came close again, so I read the scroll and landed exactly one level
above! Survived. For the moment.

On my way up, back to the main branch, I picked up some spare mithril lying
